 "text": "Hey, how are you doing? Go out just after midday and just before sunset. Save the best hour for the middle. Then save it for the second hour, after people have eaten and the sun is still bright. Email is fine, just keep it short and ask people to open it at their leisure. Ask her to open it on the day it' sent, and keep it in frame until it's read. Or have the date stamped at the post office. Make it look like an old fashioned letter in an envelope. A card with a short message is cheap and easy.",
